{"sha": "fada7db6f1ce68d0cc9d0476730d93e1fec8a57d92baad2feeaf3cdd01026a13", "body": ["\\chapter{积分}\\label{ch:g12:integ}", "", "积分同时回答两个问题：曲线下方的面积是多少，", "以及如何由函数的变化率还原出函数？微积分基本定理", "断言这两个问题本质上是同一个问题——", "这是十七世纪数学中最深刻、最有用的发现。", "", "\\section{连续函数的积分}", "", "\\begin{definition}[正函数的积分]\\label{def:g12:integ:area}", "设 $f$ 在 $\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上连续且取正值，", "则称下式为\\emph{积分}\\index{积分}：", "\\[", "\\int_a^b f(x)\\,\\dd x", "\\]", "它表示由 $f$ 的图像、$x$ 轴以及直线 $x = a$ 与 $x = b$ 所围，", "区域的面积（以面积单位计）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=8.4cm, height=5cm,", "  axis lines=middle, xmin=-0.4, xmax=3.4, ymin=-0.3, ymax=2.3,", "  xtick={0.5,2.7}, xticklabels={$a$,$b$}, ytick=\\empty,", "  samples=100, domain=-0.2:3.3]", "  \\addplot[name path=curve, omDef, thick, domain=0.2:3.2]", "    {1 + 0.5*sin(deg(2*x)) + 0.2*x};", "  \\path[name path=axis] (0.5,0) -- (2.7,0);", "  \\addplot[omDef!20] fill between[of=curve and axis, soft clip={domain=0.5:2.7}];", "  \\node at (axis cs:1.6,0.55) {$\\displaystyle\\int_a^b f$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "对于任意符号的函数，位于 $x$ 轴下方的面积计为负值；", "并规定", "$\\int_b^a f(x)\\,\\dd x = -\\int_a^b f(x)\\,\\dd x$.", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=9.6cm, height=4.8cm,", "  xmin=-0.5, xmax=7, ymin=-1.4, ymax=1.4,", "  xtick={3.1416,6.2832}, xticklabels={$\\pi$,$2\\pi$}, ytick={-1,1}]", "  \\addplot[name path=sine, omDef, thick, domain=0:6.2832, samples=120]", "    {sin(deg(x))};", "  \\path[name path=xaxis] (0,0) -- (6.2832,0);", "  \\addplot[omDef!20] fill between[of=sine and xaxis,", "    soft clip={domain=0:3.1416}];", "  \\addplot[omThm!20] fill between[of=sine and xaxis,", "    soft clip={domain=3.1416:6.2832}];", "  \\node at (axis cs:1.57,0.4) {$+$};", "  \\node at (axis cs:4.71,-0.4) {$-$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 有向面积：$\\int_0^{2\\pi} \\sin x\\,\\dd x = 0$，", "下方区域（红色）与上方区域（蓝色）相互抵消。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[积分的性质]\\label{prop:g12:integ:properties}", "设 $f, g$ 在包含 $a, b, c$ 的区间上连续，", "且 $\\lambda \\in \\R$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{线性性：}", "        $\\displaystyle\\int_a^b (f + \\lambda g) = \\int_a^b f + \\lambda \\int_a^b g$.", "  \\item \\emph{沙勒关系：}", "        $\\displaystyle\\int_a^c f = \\int_a^b f + \\int_b^c f$.", "  \\item \\emph{保号性：}若 $a \\leq b$ 且 $f \\geq 0$ 在 $\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上，", "        则 $\\displaystyle\\int_a^b f \\geq 0$；若 $f \\leq g$，则", "        $\\displaystyle\\int_a^b f \\leq \\int_a^b g$.", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "沙勒关系与保号性由面积的意义直接可得（区域拼接时面积相加，", "高度为正的区域面积为正）。比较性由保号性用于 $g - f$ 得到，", "线性性对正函数之和直观明显（将面积叠加），", "其严格证明在大学阶段给出，", "\\emph{在本阶段不加证明地承认}。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{微积分基本定理}", "", "\\begin{definition}[原函数]\\label{def:g12:integ:primitive}", "$f$ 在区间 $I$ 上的\\emph{原函数}\\index{原函数}是指函数 $F$，", "它在 $I$ 上可导，且 $F' = f$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:g12:integ:primunique}", "若 $F$ 为 $f$ 在区间 $I$ 上的原函数，则 $f$ 在 $I$ 上的全体原函数", "恰为函数 $F + c$，$c \\in \\R$。给定 $x_0 \\in I$ 及", "$y_0 \\in \\R$，存在唯一的原函数满足 $F(x_0) = y_0$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "若 $G' = F' = f$，则 $(G - F)' = 0$ 在区间 $I$ 上，故 $G - F$", "为常函数。\\footnote{区间上导数为零的函数是常函数，由", "\\cref{thm:g12:deriv:variations}可知：它既递增又递减。}", "反之，每个 $F + c$ 都是原函数。条件", "$F(x_0) = y_0$ 确定了常数。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[微积分基本定理]\\label{thm:g12:integ:ftc}", "\\index{微积分基本定理}", "设 $f$ 在区间 $I$ 上连续，$a \\in I$。函数", "\\[", "F \\colon x \\longmapsto \\int_a^x f(t)\\,\\dd t", "\\]", "是 $f$ 在 $I$ 上的原函数，且在 $a$ 处取值为零。因此，", "若 $G$ 为 $f$ 的任一原函数，$a, b \\in I$，则：", "\\[", "\\int_a^b f(t)\\,\\dd t = \\bigl[G(t)\\bigr]_a^b = G(b) - G(a).", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}